Being purified means that you won't change into ratwere anymore, but
it doesn't turn you human. Once you turned human, everything will be OK.
Just wait until you turn back or try to get killed. Sometimes it can be tricky.
(I remember once I tried to die as a werejackal, by kicking the wall. 
Unfortunately the weres have regeneration: whenever my legs went bad, I 
kept regenerating to full HP...) A good wand may be handy.

